SUMMARY:Ancient Persian and Linguistic History: A Discussion
DESCRIPTION:Kevin van Bladel’s new book Ancient Persian: A Linguistic H
 istory (Cambridge University Press 2026\, Open Access) claims that the c
 reation of the first Persian empire triggered demographic changes that c
 aused the grammar of the Persian language to be transformed. This panel 
 discussion will begin with the author’s presentation of the book in br
 ief followed by reflections of other scholars on it and its ramification
 s.\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/ancient-persian-and-linguistic
 -history-discussion
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/ancient-persian-and-linguistic-
 history-discussion
