SUMMARY:Evonne Levy - Bernini's Bronzes Project
DESCRIPTION:In this lunch seminar\, Evonne Levy\, Distinguished Professor
  of Early Modern Art at the University of Toronto Department of Art Hist
 ory\, will discuss her project “The Technical Study of Bernini’s Bro
 nzes: Art History\, Conservation\, and Material Science“. New and more
  portable tools for the imaging of works of art have opened up new possi
 bilities in the “technical study of art.” The Canadian-led collabora
 tive project “The Technical Study of Bernini’s Bronzes” is a unico
 rn of a technical study because of its comprehensive scope\, use of imag
 ing tools\, and material analysis. This talk will take you\nhttps://www.
 princeton.edu/events/2026/evonne-levy-berninis-bronzes-project
