SUMMARY:Sondheim's Afterlives Symposium
DESCRIPTION:An artistic\, scholarly\, and personal celebration of compose
 r and lyricist Stephen Sondheim\, one of the most important figures in A
 merican musical theater. This event will include panel conversations wit
 h artists and scholars and musical performances by Princeton students. C
