SUMMARY:Oratorio for Living Things by Heather Christian
DESCRIPTION:Infusing a classical oratorio with blues\, gospel\, jazz and 
 soul\, this musical and visual journey investigates human experiences of
  time and memory alongside powerful physical forces that shape the unive
 rse. Our exploration emphasizes the significance of the ritual of gather
 ing for live performance in an increasingly screen-focused world.Featuri
 ng the students of the LCA as the cast and crew\, this production is the
  first non-professional performance of this important new work which pre
 miered in 2022 in New York City to great critical acclaim.Directed by vi
 siting Iranian artist and director Niko\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/event
