SUMMARY:Introduction to Qualitative Research
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will take you through the qualitative research 
 process from start to finish. We will discuss what research questions ar
 e best suited for qualitative work\, how to choose the appropriate type 
 of qualitative methods\, and common challenges in data collection. The s
 econd half of our workshop is dedicated to qualitative analysis. You wil
 l be introduced to MaxQDA and NVivo\, two qualitative analysis research 
 sites\, and practice the general steps of translating your data into pub
 lishable findings.\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/introduction-q
 ualitative-research
