SUMMARY:Chandrashekhar Khare - Discussion
DESCRIPTION:Book Reading Chasing a Conjecture: Inside the Mind of a Mathe
 matician Q&A moderated by Akshay Venkatesh School of Mathematics\, IAS. 
 Chandrashekhar Khare is a professor of mathematics at UCLA. Together wit
 h Jean-Pierre Wintenberger\, he proved Serre’s conjecture\, which conn
 ects Galois representations and modular forms\, two central objects in n
 umber theory. His memoir\, Chasing (a) Conjecture\, tells the personal s
 tory behind this work.\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/chandrashe
 khar-khare-discussion
